{"book":"proverbs","num":18,"verses":[{"en":"Through desire a man, having separated himself, seeketh and intermeddleth with all wisdom.","n":1,"sm":"O le ua vavae ese, ua saili o ia i lona manao; e finau o ia ile poto uma lava.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"O"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"vavae"},{"en":"","sm":"ese,"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"saili"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"lona"},{"en":"","sm":"manao;"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"finau"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"ile"},{"en":"","sm":"poto"},{"en":"","sm":"uma"},{"en":"","sm":"lava."}]},{"en":"A fool hath no delight in understanding, but that his heart may discover itself.","n":2,"sm":"E le manao le vale i le faautauta; ua na ona ia faaali o lona loto.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"E"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"manao"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"vale"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"faautauta;"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"na"},{"en":"","sm":"ona"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"faaali"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"lona"},{"en":"","sm":"loto."}]},{"en":"When the wicked cometh, then cometh also contempt, and with ignominy reproach.","n":3,"sm":"A sau le tagata agasala, ua sau faatasi ai foi le ‘ino‘ino; e sau foi le luma faatasi ma le amio matagá.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"A"},{"en":"","sm":"sau"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"tagata"},{"en":"","sm":"agasala,"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"sau"},{"en":"","sm":"faatasi"},{"en":"","sm":"ai"},{"en":"","sm":"foi"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"‘ino‘ino;"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"sau"},{"en":"","sm":"foi"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"luma"},{"en":"","sm":"faatasi"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"amio"},{"en":"","sm":"matagá."}]},{"en":"The words of a man's mouth are as deep waters, and the wellspring of wisdom as a flowing brook.","n":4,"sm":"O upu a le gutu o le 